{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fuzzy optics for uncertain data fuzzy optics for uncertain data","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data.md","fileName":"Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 21:34\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network and Uncertain Data Clustering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network and Uncertain Data Clustering","dataclustering.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fuzzy optics for uncertain data fuzzy optics for uncertain data","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data.md","fileName":"Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data","heading":"Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Fuzzy OPTICS constructs a reachability ordering from uncertain or graded neighborhood relations. Reachability values then express both density scale and uncertainty in the connections among observations.\n\nThe ordering can reveal possible clusters across several thresholds without forcing early crisp assignments. A final interpretation must distinguish valleys supported strongly across uncertainty models from those created by permissive fuzzy connections.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network and Uncertain Data Clustering","dataclustering.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fuzzy OPTICS for Uncertain Data